    "title": "Smashburger - Burgers & Shakes",
    "description": "Download the official Smashburger app for the easiest way to order your favorite burgers for takeout or delivery. \r\n\r\nNewly designed for easy navigation and ordering. Find your favorite burgers, shakes, and more, and earn rewards!\r\n\r\nSmashburger App Features Include:\r\n\r\n- Mobile Ordering: Order food delivery and enjoy our fresh, made-to-order, never frozen Certified Angus Beef \u00ae , delicious, grilled-to-perfection burgers, savory sides, hand-spun milkshakes, and other fast food staples\r\n\r\n- Pickup & Delivery: Order your favorite burger even faster with quick reorder for takeout or delivery\r\n\r\n- Customize Your Food: Customize any of our burgers to your heart\u2019s content\r\n\r\n- Redeem Smashburger Points & Rewards: Sign up & collect points with every bite. It's fast, easy, and delicious, plus you can earn FREE items. \r\n\r\n- Best Food In Town: Top quality ingredients used in all our amazing creations from Smashburgers, Chicken sandwiches, Vegetarian burgers, fries, tater tots to hand-spun shakes, and refreshing drinks all available to order for takeout, pickup or delivery\r\n\r\n- Find Your Local Smashburger: Your closest restaurant is just a tap away to pick up or deliver your next burger meal",
    "descriptionHTML": "Download the official Smashburger app for the easiest way to order your favorite burgers for takeout or delivery. <br><br>Newly designed for easy navigation and ordering. Find your favorite burgers, shakes, and more, and earn rewards!<br><br>Smashburger App Features Include:<br><br>- Mobile Ordering: Order food delivery and enjoy our fresh, made-to-order, never frozen Certified Angus Beef \u00ae , delicious, grilled-to-perfection burgers, savory sides, hand-spun milkshakes, and other fast food staples<br><br>- Pickup &amp; Delivery: Order your favorite burger even faster with quick reorder for takeout or delivery<br><br>- Customize Your Food: Customize any of our burgers to your heart\u2019s content<br><br>- Redeem Smashburger Points &amp; Rewards: Sign up &amp; collect points with every bite. It&#39;s fast, easy, and delicious, plus you can earn FREE items. <br><br>- Best Food In Town: Top quality ingredients used in all our amazing creations from Smashburgers, Chicken sandwiches, Vegetarian burgers, fries, tater tots to hand-spun shakes, and refreshing drinks all available to order for takeout, pickup or delivery<br><br>- Find Your Local Smashburger: Your closest restaurant is just a tap away to pick up or deliver your next burger meal",
